WEBVTT

00:09.944 --> 00:11.944
MkvDrama.me

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:40.504 --> 01:42.906
=Episode 5=
(No Feelings for Me at All?)

01:54.048 --> 01:55.328
You're truly blessed.

01:55.767 --> 01:56.888
Hui is a good girl.

01:57.408 --> 01:58.048
Thank you.

01:58.488 --> 01:59.328
Luzhou, you're back.

02:00.368 --> 02:01.247
Let me introduce you.

02:01.528 --> 02:02.687
This is Ms. Xue.

02:02.888 --> 02:03.968
Professor Jiang's wife.

02:04.528 --> 02:05.727
This is Luzhou, my son.

02:06.328 --> 02:07.008
Hello, Ms. Xue.

02:07.247 --> 02:07.888
Hello.

02:07.888 --> 02:08.687
Have a seat.

02:09.408 --> 02:09.928
Sit down.

02:09.928 --> 02:11.048
- Please, have a seat.
- Sit.

02:14.647 --> 02:15.287
She's

02:15.528 --> 02:16.167
Hui.

02:16.607 --> 02:18.647
Professor Jiang mentioned her before.
His daughter.

02:18.928 --> 02:20.287
She's off to Ruicheng University

02:20.368 --> 02:21.287
in a few days.

02:21.727 --> 02:22.888
That way, the two of you can

02:23.008 --> 02:24.127
watch out for each other.

02:24.567 --> 02:25.368
Right, Hui?

02:26.247 --> 02:26.848
Okay.

02:27.808 --> 02:28.408
By the way,

02:28.607 --> 02:30.048
your dad will be at the airport.

02:30.247 --> 02:33.448
Go pick him up, and also drop off Hui.

02:33.448 --> 02:34.727
She's off to Bohui for a movie.

02:36.127 --> 02:36.607
Okay.

02:40.167 --> 02:40.888
Thank you, Ma'am.

02:41.087 --> 02:41.687
You're welcome.

02:42.247 --> 02:43.767
Come, have some fruit.

02:43.888 --> 02:44.448
Feel free.

02:51.008 --> 02:53.328
Dad, I'm washing up.

02:53.968 --> 02:54.808
Up so early?

02:55.808 --> 02:57.647
Didn't you watch
the meteor shower last night?

02:58.408 --> 02:59.687
How did you know?

03:00.968 --> 03:01.928
Did Yingying tell you?

03:03.087 --> 03:04.287
I saw it on your social media.

03:07.328 --> 03:07.928
Right...

03:08.968 --> 03:09.928
Who is Chen Luzhou?

03:10.167 --> 03:11.848
(Oh no, I forgot to block him.)

03:14.247 --> 03:15.207
It's

03:16.247 --> 03:17.607
a friend I recently met.

03:18.968 --> 03:19.448
A guy?

03:21.087 --> 03:22.247
He's good at taking photos.

03:23.968 --> 03:25.087
Why are you asking?

03:25.888 --> 03:26.448
Never mind.

03:26.727 --> 03:27.247
Well...

03:28.087 --> 03:29.167
That Zhou guy

03:29.528 --> 03:30.888
takes quite good pictures.

03:31.087 --> 03:31.647
Pretty good.

03:32.727 --> 03:34.167
If there's nothing else, bye.

03:34.448 --> 03:35.448
Oh right.

03:35.647 --> 03:37.767
There seems to be a typhoon
in a couple of days.

03:37.888 --> 03:39.247
Once finished,

03:39.448 --> 03:40.167
return early.

03:40.848 --> 03:41.488
Bye.

03:48.056 --> 03:49.272
(Zhu Yangqi)

03:54.328 --> 03:55.488
Hello.

04:00.127 --> 04:01.767
Chen Xingqi is unwilling to paint.

04:01.767 --> 04:02.767
Why look for Xu Zhi?

04:02.928 --> 04:04.207
If you can't do it, she can?

04:05.368 --> 04:06.368
Based on my observation,

04:07.008 --> 04:09.087
Chen Xingqi is not afraid of anything,

04:09.207 --> 04:10.647
except for Xu Zhi.

04:11.127 --> 04:11.808
Alright.

04:12.328 --> 04:13.408
I'll ask

04:13.408 --> 04:15.207
will she help Chen Luzhou
with his brother.

04:15.968 --> 04:16.647
Sure.

04:17.207 --> 04:18.528
Eight hundred a day for me.

04:18.848 --> 04:20.647
Alright, that's a deal.

04:21.567 --> 04:22.767
Where has Chen Luzhou gone?

04:23.087 --> 04:24.368
Why isn't he taking his brother?

04:24.727 --> 04:26.968
Chen Luzhou went on a blind date today.

04:29.167 --> 04:30.207
- Blind date?
- Blind date?

04:32.287 --> 04:33.888
The car's parked a bit far.

04:34.048 --> 04:35.048
Need to walk a bit.

04:37.408 --> 04:37.808
Hello.

04:39.647 --> 04:40.687
I'll be out soon.

04:43.528 --> 04:44.448
My boyfriend's there.

04:44.727 --> 04:45.287
No need.

04:46.207 --> 04:46.687
Boyfriend?

04:49.808 --> 04:50.687
Don't tell my parents.

04:51.127 --> 04:52.127
We

04:52.408 --> 04:53.808
are planning to go abroad together.

04:55.368 --> 04:56.607
Don't worry. Once we're abroad,

04:56.928 --> 04:57.808
I won't trouble you.

04:58.647 --> 04:59.287
It's not you.

04:59.687 --> 05:01.087
I dislike chatting, not your fault.

05:01.767 --> 05:03.048
It's between my mom and me.

05:04.928 --> 05:06.167
Ms. Lian is quite nice.

05:07.607 --> 05:09.647
She's actually very proud of you.

05:10.048 --> 05:10.848
You might not know,

05:11.008 --> 05:13.247
but she often tells my mom
and others at work

05:13.488 --> 05:15.928
how outstanding
and how hardworking you are.

05:17.207 --> 05:19.448
My mom says she's just tough-talking
but soft-hearted.

05:19.607 --> 05:20.928
In fact, it's obvious.

05:21.048 --> 05:22.087
She cares about you a lot.

05:27.127 --> 05:28.127
From No.1 High School?

05:28.528 --> 05:30.928
With your good grades
and handsome looks,

05:31.087 --> 05:32.408
many girls must like you.

05:33.207 --> 05:33.928
Not really.

05:34.528 --> 05:35.328
How come?

05:35.767 --> 05:37.207
Do you have a girlfriend?

05:37.928 --> 05:38.408
No.

05:39.048 --> 05:40.848
Then you must like someone.

05:43.247 --> 05:43.968
Sort of.

05:45.448 --> 05:46.287
Add me on WeChat.

05:46.448 --> 05:47.607
Let's have dinner abroad.

05:47.968 --> 05:49.488
As a thank you for keeping my secret.

05:50.448 --> 05:51.328
That's your boyfriend?

05:53.888 --> 05:54.567
Hui.

05:55.207 --> 05:55.687
Bye.

06:03.528 --> 06:03.928
Let's go.

06:04.448 --> 06:04.767
Go.

06:05.767 --> 06:06.848
Watch a movie or eat?

06:08.167 --> 06:09.207
- Eat.
- Okay.

06:09.207 --> 06:10.167
I haven't eaten much.

06:11.848 --> 06:13.687
(Xu Zhi is indeed quite pretty.)

06:14.127 --> 06:15.687
But the girls who pursued you before,

06:15.808 --> 06:16.647
were all pretty.

06:17.008 --> 06:18.968
What's different with her
compared to other girls

06:19.607 --> 06:22.247
is that she has a boyfriend.

06:23.048 --> 06:25.567
(Zhu Yangqi, you're completely wrong.)

06:25.567 --> 06:27.567
(I don't like girls
who have boyfriends.)

06:27.808 --> 06:28.848
(I just...)

06:35.567 --> 06:37.528
Can you guess
where Xu Zhi took Chen Xingqi?

06:39.687 --> 06:40.048
Go ahead.

06:40.448 --> 06:41.528
Foot massage parlor.

06:42.408 --> 06:44.328
She said Chen Xingqi's feet
were too smelly.

06:44.528 --> 06:45.928
Chen Xingqi's face turned green.

06:46.287 --> 06:47.328
In your family,

06:47.448 --> 06:49.008
who would dare to openly despise him?

06:49.247 --> 06:50.808
Even Chen Xingqi has a day like this.

06:51.607 --> 06:53.008
I told you before

06:53.008 --> 06:54.767
that if Xu Zhi could be your girlfriend,

06:54.848 --> 06:56.647
then someone could handle Chen Xingqi.

07:01.127 --> 07:02.848
How did your blind date go?

07:03.767 --> 07:05.167
I told you it's not a blind date.

07:07.368 --> 07:08.008
Did you...

07:08.727 --> 07:10.567
Did you tell Xu Zhi
I went on a blind date?

07:11.008 --> 07:11.848
Yes, I did.

07:13.048 --> 07:13.687
What'd she say?

07:14.048 --> 07:16.528
She said you were talking nonsense

07:16.528 --> 07:18.127
about interviews

07:19.087 --> 07:20.167
and blind dates.

07:21.087 --> 07:21.808
And then?

07:22.607 --> 07:23.287
She asked you

07:23.408 --> 07:24.968
do you want Chen Xingqi's business.

07:25.087 --> 07:26.048
If not,

07:26.207 --> 07:27.448
then she'll take over.

07:28.368 --> 07:29.848
Tell her to dream on.

07:40.928 --> 07:43.328
(No feelings for me at all?)

07:55.087 --> 07:55.528
Three.

07:56.448 --> 07:57.127
Three?

08:02.167 --> 08:03.207
What did Chen Luzhou say?

08:03.408 --> 08:04.408
Did he agree I take over?

08:05.968 --> 08:06.767
He said no way.

08:07.368 --> 08:08.127
Stingy.

08:09.767 --> 08:10.167
Six.

08:13.488 --> 08:14.008
Pass.

08:16.367 --> 08:17.968
Zhu Yangqi, are you a pig?

08:17.968 --> 08:19.087
I'm on the same team as you.

08:19.087 --> 08:20.207
Why do you block my cards?

08:20.447 --> 08:21.648
Do you even know how to play?

08:21.768 --> 08:23.407
My cards are good, okay?

08:29.447 --> 08:30.087
Hello.

08:30.087 --> 08:30.848
Welcome.

08:30.848 --> 08:31.247
Hello.

08:31.247 --> 08:31.808
Two people?

08:31.808 --> 08:32.407
I...

08:32.527 --> 08:33.207
Zhai Xiao.

08:33.608 --> 08:33.968
Okay.

08:34.688 --> 08:35.487
Bad guy.

08:36.207 --> 08:37.087
I'll handle him.

08:38.648 --> 08:39.207
Wait a moment.

08:40.487 --> 08:40.848
Look.

08:43.768 --> 08:44.608
Not bad here.

08:44.848 --> 08:45.848
I was here before.

08:46.447 --> 08:47.127
It's quite nice.

08:47.447 --> 08:48.247
She is...

08:49.048 --> 08:49.688
Chai Jingjing?

08:50.367 --> 08:50.968
No.

08:51.888 --> 08:52.928
That's too bizarre.

08:53.367 --> 08:54.808
This guy needs handling.

08:55.247 --> 08:57.087
Otherwise,
more naive girls will get hurt.

08:57.287 --> 08:57.928
How?

08:58.648 --> 08:59.287
What do we do?

08:59.447 --> 09:00.008
Got it.

09:00.207 --> 09:01.648
We record it and then expose him.

09:02.327 --> 09:02.688
Okay.

09:05.207 --> 09:05.648
Alright.

09:06.928 --> 09:07.367
Thank you.

09:09.848 --> 09:10.287
Stop.

09:12.327 --> 09:12.768
What?

09:16.407 --> 09:18.287
Fur. It must be from the tree.

09:18.527 --> 09:19.048
Receive it.

09:19.407 --> 09:20.487
- Okay.
- You can get her?

09:21.167 --> 09:24.287
I'll send a message to Chai Jingjing
with my secondary account.

09:33.968 --> 09:34.608
Hello.

09:34.608 --> 09:35.728
- Hello.
- Some water.

09:35.888 --> 09:36.367
Okay.

09:40.167 --> 09:40.608
Who is it?

09:40.768 --> 09:41.407
It's nothing.

09:44.048 --> 09:44.648
Please enjoy.

09:49.080 --> 09:49.805
(Chai Jingjing)

09:50.527 --> 09:51.888
Chai Jingjing?

09:52.407 --> 09:53.127
Who's that?

09:53.848 --> 09:54.487
My cousin.

09:56.207 --> 09:57.768
Maybe something's happening at home.

09:58.127 --> 09:58.928
It does seem urgent.

09:59.648 --> 10:00.968
Let me take this call.

10:01.648 --> 10:02.127
Alright.

10:02.568 --> 10:03.048
Okay.

10:03.207 --> 10:04.207
Wait for me for a moment.

10:10.008 --> 10:10.688
Hello, Jingjing.

10:15.407 --> 10:16.527
Let me explain.

10:17.968 --> 10:19.087
Tomorrow...

10:19.087 --> 10:19.768
Tomorrow I'll...

10:20.808 --> 10:22.008
Don't explain, bad guy.

10:22.487 --> 10:23.447
Bad guy, we're done!

10:27.728 --> 10:28.968
Stop it, or I'll call the cops.

10:29.287 --> 10:29.848
Bad guy.

10:31.327 --> 10:32.008
Serves him right.

10:32.008 --> 10:32.487
Ling.

10:49.048 --> 10:50.048
Cai Yingying?

10:53.447 --> 10:54.487
You guys did it?

10:57.848 --> 10:59.087
Yes, it was us. What about it?

11:01.447 --> 11:02.728
Are you clinging to me?

11:03.327 --> 11:04.367
You followed me here.

11:04.367 --> 11:05.287
We're not related.

11:05.367 --> 11:06.608
Why are you so clingy?

11:06.888 --> 11:07.728
Pester you?

11:08.327 --> 11:09.728
Yingying has great eyesight.

11:09.848 --> 11:10.648
It's 5.3.

11:12.688 --> 11:13.648
Let's go out.

11:13.728 --> 11:14.407
What?

11:14.407 --> 11:15.487
What? Starting a fight?

11:16.447 --> 11:17.367
Want to fight?

11:19.512 --> 11:22.728
Do you know that
Xu Zhi's uncle owns this villa.

11:24.808 --> 11:27.287
What good outcome can there be

11:27.728 --> 11:28.928
misbehaving here?

11:29.688 --> 11:30.048
You...

11:39.327 --> 11:39.888
Just wait.

11:40.127 --> 11:41.407
Thank you for the reminder.

11:41.968 --> 11:43.167
I'm not ambitious enough.

11:43.447 --> 11:44.888
I don't know what I want.

11:45.527 --> 11:47.207
But now I'm very sure

11:47.207 --> 11:48.527
what I don't want.

11:49.367 --> 11:49.888
Like you,

11:50.087 --> 11:51.688
a piece of non-recyclable trash.

11:57.487 --> 11:58.367
You all just wait.

11:58.768 --> 11:59.247
Just wait.

12:02.808 --> 12:03.407
It's okay.

12:03.848 --> 12:04.487
High five.

12:21.808 --> 12:22.527
Give it to me.

12:25.608 --> 12:27.327
What have you been busy with lately?

12:28.247 --> 12:30.127
Accompanying Chen Xingqi
to paint at the villa.

12:31.167 --> 12:31.688
Luzhou,

12:33.127 --> 12:34.048
that day, I...

12:34.048 --> 12:34.968
It was my fault.

12:35.928 --> 12:36.848
I was too much.

12:39.247 --> 12:39.728
By the way,

12:40.127 --> 12:41.728
everything is settled at school.

12:41.928 --> 12:43.688
I bought an apartment nearby for you.

12:43.888 --> 12:46.648
Living at home is always
more comfortable than staying in a dorm.

12:48.247 --> 12:49.207
Thanks, Dad.

12:51.167 --> 12:51.648
Let's go.

12:57.287 --> 12:59.127
The weather has been very dry lately.

12:59.247 --> 13:00.287
I made some pear soup.

13:00.608 --> 13:01.167
Look.

13:01.808 --> 13:02.848
How nice it is.

13:02.968 --> 13:03.728
We're back.

13:04.247 --> 13:04.968
You're back.

13:06.728 --> 13:08.048
You must be tired from the trip.

13:09.648 --> 13:11.648
Wash your hands. Ms. Mei made pear soup.

13:12.447 --> 13:14.327
Get me a bowl. I'll go make a call.

13:14.568 --> 13:15.167
Drink later.

13:15.287 --> 13:15.848
Alright.

13:18.407 --> 13:19.127
Luzhou.

13:19.127 --> 13:20.367
Come, have a bowl of pear soup.

13:24.568 --> 13:25.447
Thank you, Ms. Mei.

13:26.487 --> 13:26.848
Come on.

13:27.768 --> 13:29.688
Want a spoon? No?

13:31.447 --> 13:33.447
Wash your hands before you drink it.

13:34.487 --> 13:35.648
Changing your face quickly.

13:36.048 --> 13:36.768
Here's a spoon.

13:36.768 --> 13:38.048
You should be in Sichuan Opera.

13:38.487 --> 13:38.808
No.

13:42.968 --> 13:43.648
Want some?

13:44.407 --> 13:45.648
I'll drink it later.

13:47.688 --> 13:48.968
Drink to dissipate the heat.

13:52.087 --> 13:53.207
What did your dad say to you

13:53.207 --> 13:54.127
along the trip?

13:56.008 --> 13:56.928
He told me

13:56.968 --> 13:58.768
once I get settled at school abroad,

13:59.407 --> 14:00.487
he'll buy me an apartment.

14:01.008 --> 14:01.768
Look.

14:02.648 --> 14:03.648
Your dad cares about you.

14:07.127 --> 14:08.087
Remember

14:08.087 --> 14:09.327
when we traveled to Spain?

14:09.527 --> 14:10.968
You didn't buy the speaker

14:11.247 --> 14:12.848
to buy Xingqi a drawing board.

14:13.247 --> 14:14.087
When your dad heard,

14:14.167 --> 14:15.527
he spent the money for his suit

14:15.527 --> 14:16.568
to buy you the speaker.

14:17.247 --> 14:18.287
I joked,

14:18.768 --> 14:20.688
"You can wear a suit for years,

14:20.888 --> 14:22.848
but will the speaker last that long?

14:23.247 --> 14:23.888
Is it worth it?"

14:24.568 --> 14:25.568
He said it's worth it.

14:25.968 --> 14:28.247
If his son likes it,
that's all that matters.

14:30.247 --> 14:31.008
I know.

14:32.048 --> 14:33.048
I know he's good to me.

14:34.648 --> 14:35.728
I won't let him down.

14:47.352 --> 14:49.720
(Convenience Store)

15:01.624 --> 15:04.679
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

15:07.736 --> 15:12.632
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

15:14.904 --> 15:18.872
♪The world is too quiet♪

15:20.312 --> 15:26.363
♪Amplify every sound♪

15:28.216 --> 15:32.259
♪Who will visit me♪

15:34.424 --> 15:39.311
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

15:39.527 --> 15:41.127
(Seen my cousin's Chinese exam paper.)

15:41.167 --> 15:43.127
(Use 'not only, but also'
for a sentence.)

15:43.127 --> 15:43.808
(He said,)

15:44.688 --> 15:46.207
("My sister not only loves money,)

15:46.648 --> 15:47.688
(but also has no money.")

15:49.568 --> 15:50.728
(I can't tutor him anymore.)

15:54.728 --> 15:56.008
(On my eighteenth birthday,)

15:56.207 --> 15:58.207
(my dad gave me a watch with cracks.)

15:58.648 --> 16:00.608
(I thought it was
some valuable heirloom.)

16:01.487 --> 16:02.327
(But he said)

16:03.447 --> 16:05.167
(that was the one I broke as a child.)

16:05.407 --> 16:07.367
(Now I'm an adult,
he can collect the debt.)

16:08.568 --> 16:09.568
(Get ready to work.)

16:14.167 --> 16:15.287
Where are you?

16:15.928 --> 16:16.768
Still down here.

16:18.768 --> 16:20.367
Bring some things back when you return.

16:20.367 --> 16:21.367
I'm starving.

16:22.048 --> 16:22.608
Want what?

16:23.247 --> 16:24.167
Some instant noodles.

16:24.287 --> 16:25.568
Don't forget Xingqi's water.

16:25.928 --> 16:27.367
You can choose the rest as you like.

16:28.728 --> 16:29.447
What about Xu Zhi?

16:30.608 --> 16:31.447
You tell him.

16:32.287 --> 16:33.127
Chen Luzhou.

16:33.527 --> 16:34.527
Which Lu is it?

16:34.808 --> 16:35.768
Lu as in dumb.

16:36.648 --> 16:36.968
Alright.

16:38.247 --> 16:38.848
Forget it.

16:39.048 --> 16:40.048
I wanted to bring you

16:40.327 --> 16:41.407
two bottles of juice back.

16:42.008 --> 16:42.928
Lu as in twists

16:42.928 --> 16:44.487
and turns, all roads lead to Rome.

16:45.728 --> 16:46.247
Too late.

16:46.928 --> 16:48.728
Not late. You'll buy them for me.

16:49.008 --> 16:49.888
Dream on.

17:21.407 --> 17:22.008
Hello.

17:22.407 --> 17:24.327
Where are you?
I'm tired of playing cards.

17:24.688 --> 17:25.768
In such a hurry to see me?

17:26.247 --> 17:28.527
Rider, the order is overdue.

17:29.487 --> 17:30.808
Sorry, Ms. Xu.

17:31.247 --> 17:32.247
Don't give a bad review.

17:32.568 --> 17:34.008
Depends on how long I wait.

17:35.487 --> 17:36.447
About half an hour.

17:37.287 --> 17:37.768
Okay.

17:38.407 --> 17:39.648
They're returning to rest.

17:40.048 --> 17:41.087
Meet downstairs

17:41.568 --> 17:42.568
at the restaurant?

17:43.087 --> 17:43.487
Okay.

17:54.127 --> 17:54.648
Hello.

17:55.487 --> 17:56.127
Two of us.

17:56.287 --> 17:56.808
Hello.

17:57.407 --> 17:58.207
Sorry.

17:58.327 --> 17:59.568
No personal drinks here.

18:02.287 --> 18:03.568
So, should we still drink them?

18:04.207 --> 18:05.247
I won't waste them.

18:06.207 --> 18:08.048
I think there's an AV room nearby.

18:09.327 --> 18:10.127
Lead the way.

18:22.087 --> 18:22.608
Come in.

18:25.648 --> 18:26.487
Sorry about that.

18:26.808 --> 18:28.087
We only have this one left here.

18:28.527 --> 18:29.167
How about it?

18:30.407 --> 18:31.568
No problem. This one is fine.

18:32.367 --> 18:32.688
Okay.

18:32.808 --> 18:33.407
Thank you.

18:58.008 --> 18:58.888
Watch what?

18:58.888 --> 18:59.968
I'm fine. Up to you.

19:00.527 --> 19:01.327
I'll choose.

19:15.544 --> 19:17.562
(Daily Legal Education)

19:22.608 --> 19:24.407
(Power of Law)
(Punish the illegal and warn society.)

19:24.728 --> 19:26.688
(Welcome to Daily Legal Education.)

19:34.407 --> 19:35.048
Thank you.

19:46.928 --> 19:48.087
You're not happy?

19:49.888 --> 19:50.648
No.

19:50.968 --> 19:52.207
Because of the blind date?

19:53.487 --> 19:55.367
Don't listen to Zhu Yangqi's nonsense.

19:57.127 --> 19:58.648
My mom tricked me.

19:58.808 --> 20:00.247
She took me to meet a girl

20:00.247 --> 20:02.167
and asked me to look after her abroad.

20:02.327 --> 20:03.527
But she has a boyfriend.

20:05.287 --> 20:06.407
Why are you saying so much?

20:06.527 --> 20:07.167
I didn't ask.

20:07.808 --> 20:08.688
I don't care.

20:09.207 --> 20:10.207
I just feel that

20:10.207 --> 20:11.728
you look a bit off today.

20:12.768 --> 20:13.608
You need a drink

20:13.608 --> 20:14.552
more than whining.

20:28.648 --> 20:29.688
I'm just asking casually.

20:29.928 --> 20:30.728
No hard feelings.

20:30.928 --> 20:31.367
Go ahead.

20:35.207 --> 20:35.888
Have you thought

20:35.888 --> 20:36.928
about what kind

20:37.367 --> 20:38.207
of guy you want?

20:40.808 --> 20:42.648
No, I'll let fate decide.

20:42.768 --> 20:44.327
But I'm somewhat superficial.

20:44.688 --> 20:45.888
I prefer someone smart,

20:46.087 --> 20:47.167
and also earn money.

20:48.048 --> 20:49.207
Because if they're too dumb,

20:49.728 --> 20:50.968
even if they're very handsome,

20:51.568 --> 20:52.167
I refuse.

20:52.688 --> 20:53.327
I don't like it.

20:55.728 --> 20:57.048
Too exhausting to communicate.

20:57.167 --> 20:57.888
I'm not patient.

21:00.608 --> 21:02.447
How to judge intelligence?

21:03.768 --> 21:05.447
Most people have similar intelligence,

21:05.527 --> 21:06.888
except for a few exceptions.

21:07.327 --> 21:08.167
So, before dating,

21:08.167 --> 21:10.367
would you take someone
to the hospital for an IQ test?

21:11.928 --> 21:13.527
That's why I say I'm superficial.

21:13.888 --> 21:15.568
For now, I can only rely on feelings.

21:16.008 --> 21:17.888
College Entrance Examination
is a divide.

21:18.048 --> 21:19.768
Between high scorers and others,

21:19.768 --> 21:21.207
they naturally part ways.

21:23.207 --> 21:24.327
I'm not talking about you.

21:24.968 --> 21:26.247
You're from No.1 High School.

21:26.487 --> 21:28.087
A lean camel is bigger than a horse.

21:34.407 --> 21:36.367
Planning to date once you're in college?

21:38.527 --> 21:39.207
At fate's will.

21:42.247 --> 21:43.527
Qingyi University is average.

21:43.768 --> 21:44.728
Which school is nice?

21:45.527 --> 21:46.527
Jing and Hua Universities

21:46.728 --> 21:47.447
are both okay.

21:47.968 --> 21:49.087
(So cocky.)

21:49.407 --> 21:50.768
(Hua and Jing Universities?)

21:51.527 --> 21:53.127
(Failed and still thinking this?)

21:53.728 --> 21:55.768
(Really dreaming big
despite being mediocre.)

21:55.888 --> 21:56.407
What's wrong?

21:58.407 --> 21:59.008
Nothing.

22:00.608 --> 22:02.207
I think your idea is quite good.

22:14.167 --> 22:14.728
(Alright.)

22:14.808 --> 22:16.768
(That's all for today's program.)

22:16.768 --> 22:17.487
(Thanks.)

22:17.768 --> 22:19.367
(Morality and Rule of Law)
(See you.)

22:56.472 --> 23:02.606
♪Like a breeze,
drifting through the sky♪

23:03.608 --> 23:08.347
♪It wipes away
the trails of sorrow's sigh♪

23:12.527 --> 23:13.447
Mine is gone.

23:13.688 --> 23:14.848
You're not drinking anymore.

23:15.048 --> 23:16.087
I wanted to drink yours.

23:17.464 --> 23:22.202
♪Waiting for an encounter♪

23:23.224 --> 23:26.350
♪The heartbeat reminds♪

23:26.808 --> 23:27.327
Thank you.

23:27.407 --> 23:28.608
Then I'll leave it to you.

23:29.848 --> 23:36.728
♪Let every chapter of the story align♪

23:39.416 --> 23:42.700
♪Even if it rains on you♪

23:43.466 --> 23:46.285
♪I will always be with you♪

23:47.192 --> 23:50.520
♪Like a rainbow appears♪

23:51.096 --> 23:53.144
♪Our love will last♪

23:53.336 --> 23:56.285
♪Even if it rains on you♪

23:56.690 --> 23:59.823
♪I will always be with you♪

24:01.144 --> 24:04.121
♪I will let you know♪

24:04.664 --> 24:05.928
♪You're the only one♪

24:05.928 --> 24:06.888
What's on your mind?

24:08.367 --> 24:10.407
If the person on the show

24:10.888 --> 24:13.207
hadn't been so worried
about what others thought,

24:13.207 --> 24:14.728
would he have ended up like that?

24:15.287 --> 24:16.848
Everyone has a wall in their heart.

24:17.287 --> 24:18.207
It seems solid,

24:18.808 --> 24:19.768
but it can be broken

24:19.768 --> 24:20.808
by one sentence,

24:21.087 --> 24:22.287
or a moment of collapse.

24:24.568 --> 24:26.648
So, if your wall of heart collapses,

24:27.127 --> 24:28.167
then what will you do?

24:37.407 --> 24:39.848
I'll look into this question
and then get back to you.

24:41.207 --> 24:41.928
Okay.

24:43.888 --> 24:45.367
Typhoon weather is coming.

24:45.527 --> 24:46.808
I'll leave here tomorrow.

24:47.287 --> 24:49.008
Dad is about to switch
to the night shift.

24:49.008 --> 24:50.688
I can't leave my grandma home alone.

24:53.287 --> 24:54.928
I should probably take Chen Xingqi down.

24:59.848 --> 25:00.487
By the way,

25:01.207 --> 25:03.127
I got a job to Linshi today.

25:03.247 --> 25:04.247
Needs a photographer.

25:06.167 --> 25:08.048
How much do you plan to hire me for?

25:08.327 --> 25:09.968
How much are you thinking? Name a price.

25:10.127 --> 25:11.008
Keep it reasonable.

25:12.087 --> 25:12.688
Okay.

25:13.928 --> 25:14.928
Okay, goodnight.

25:17.407 --> 25:17.888
Goodnight.

25:37.247 --> 25:37.688
Dad.

25:37.888 --> 25:38.447
You're back.

25:40.888 --> 25:42.928
Such a feast, do we have guests today?

25:43.207 --> 25:44.008
No guests at all.

25:44.287 --> 25:45.327
Just welcoming you back.

25:46.768 --> 25:47.808
Better be.

25:48.688 --> 25:49.327
Where's Grandma?

25:51.008 --> 25:52.688
She suddenly said
that the city is noisy.

25:52.808 --> 25:53.688
Desires rural living.

25:53.808 --> 25:54.608
I'm telling you.

25:54.728 --> 25:55.888
She just wants to go back

25:56.008 --> 25:57.247
to find her friends there.

25:57.808 --> 25:59.527
I brought back the tea for you.

26:01.487 --> 26:02.327
You really thought.

26:03.768 --> 26:05.287
Wash your hands and eat.

26:05.407 --> 26:06.127
Smells so good.

26:07.127 --> 26:08.087
Go wash your hands.

26:24.247 --> 26:24.768
- Dad.
- Zhi.

26:24.928 --> 26:25.527
Go ahead.

26:29.407 --> 26:30.648
Do you think I have

26:31.768 --> 26:32.728
any changes today?

26:35.207 --> 26:36.728
You changed your hairstyle?

26:37.447 --> 26:38.688
You're much energetic.

26:38.688 --> 26:39.287
That's right.

26:39.928 --> 26:41.287
Then take another look at home.

26:41.728 --> 26:42.608
Any changes?

26:43.247 --> 26:44.247
At home...

26:47.367 --> 26:48.407
It's spotless clean.

26:48.768 --> 26:49.848
Did you hire a maid?

26:50.367 --> 26:51.487
What maid?

26:51.768 --> 26:53.648
Even a maid can't clean
as well as I did.

26:53.648 --> 26:56.048
I did everything up and down by myself.

26:57.888 --> 26:58.447
And then?

26:59.688 --> 27:01.527
Then the hospital said

27:02.207 --> 27:02.928
they want to bond.

27:03.648 --> 27:04.888
This time we'll go to Sanya.

27:05.127 --> 27:06.048
Then I thought

27:06.287 --> 27:07.127
I have vacation.

27:07.407 --> 27:09.568
Why not take your grandma to Beijing?

27:10.287 --> 27:11.327
What's your point?

27:14.928 --> 27:15.888
I hope you

27:16.480 --> 27:17.608
to attend a Beijing college.

27:19.287 --> 27:19.928
Dad.

27:21.848 --> 27:24.048
I already discussed it with Cai.

27:24.527 --> 27:25.367
He also said

27:25.768 --> 27:27.688
with your estimated score,
Qingyi University

27:27.688 --> 27:28.648
is really a compromise.

27:29.367 --> 27:30.728
And your homeroom teacher, Mr. Qu,

27:31.048 --> 27:32.728
specially called to tell me

27:32.928 --> 27:34.127
to be sure to persuade you.

27:34.367 --> 27:36.327
He thinks you're young and outstanding,

27:36.487 --> 27:38.407
and should go out to explore
and see the world.

27:42.568 --> 27:43.287
Don't worry.

27:43.287 --> 27:44.247
When you're not around,

27:44.247 --> 27:44.808
I can

27:44.808 --> 27:46.087
take care of myself very well.

27:46.087 --> 27:47.487
Look how well I've kept the house.

27:52.968 --> 27:54.808
This is my last confidence,

27:56.207 --> 27:58.127
enough until your PhD graduation.

27:59.048 --> 27:59.327
Wait.

27:59.327 --> 28:00.888
Where did you get so much money?

28:01.608 --> 28:02.808
Didn't I tell you?

28:02.808 --> 28:03.928
Mr. Lin, the lottery guy,

28:03.928 --> 28:05.207
owes our family five million.

28:05.728 --> 28:06.447
Alright.

28:06.527 --> 28:08.728
Our family's savings
are more than Grandma's Fun Beans.

28:08.728 --> 28:09.287
Okay?

28:09.407 --> 28:09.808
Okay.

28:11.327 --> 28:12.888
Think about it what I just

28:12.968 --> 28:13.928
told you carefully.

28:14.447 --> 28:15.888
I need to go to the hospital now.

28:17.008 --> 28:18.247
You wash the dishes today.

28:55.160 --> 28:59.150
♪On a midsummer night♪

28:59.150 --> 29:04.400
♪The drowsy streetlights
softly start to mend♪

29:05.368 --> 29:08.070
♪The moonlight
penetrates the tree shades♪

29:09.304 --> 29:13.752
♪Chasing the distance
between you and me♪

29:15.544 --> 29:17.973
♪On the mountaintop
where the shooting stars pass♪

29:18.200 --> 29:20.393
♪The silhouette is frozen in eternity♪

29:20.728 --> 29:22.840
♪Fireworks, cicadas chirping,
heartbeat breathing♪

29:22.968 --> 29:25.496
♪The whole world pauses♪

29:26.481 --> 29:29.124
♪Messages connecting the universe♪

29:53.752 --> 29:55.752
(WeChat Transfer)

29:57.688 --> 29:59.608
(Let's split the movie ticket cost.)

30:02.848 --> 30:05.008
(I can still afford
to treat you to a movie.)

30:07.928 --> 30:10.087
(I can afford to watch a movie too.)

30:21.327 --> 30:23.487
(College in Ruicheng
is sending out admission offers.)

30:23.808 --> 30:25.327
(Make sure to check your email.)

30:59.520 --> 31:00.991
(Watch the meteor shower)

31:33.487 --> 31:34.568
Dad,

31:35.127 --> 31:36.367
Beijing has heating.

31:36.648 --> 31:37.728
An electric blanket?

31:37.728 --> 31:39.928
Are you trying to make me
get heat rash in winter?

31:48.327 --> 31:49.167
How about

31:49.367 --> 31:50.447
I get her to meet you?

31:51.167 --> 31:52.608
You can give her these photos.

31:53.407 --> 31:54.048
Forget it.

31:54.447 --> 31:56.407
So she won't bring up
the money issue again.

31:58.127 --> 31:59.928
Weren't you two doing well

32:00.087 --> 32:00.928
at Fu Yu Villa?

32:01.487 --> 32:01.968
Why

32:02.888 --> 32:03.848
suddenly become distant?

32:04.568 --> 32:06.127
I've been thinking why I like her

32:07.207 --> 32:08.808
these past few days.

32:10.127 --> 32:11.008
Love at first sight?

32:12.247 --> 32:12.928
Maybe.

32:14.008 --> 32:16.848
But I think it's more likely
due to a sense of conquest.

32:18.287 --> 32:19.287
I see.

32:19.808 --> 32:20.648
It's because

32:21.608 --> 32:22.247
she

32:22.447 --> 32:23.568
isn't interested in you.

32:23.888 --> 32:24.928
So, unlike those girls

32:24.928 --> 32:27.768
who admired and pursued you.

32:28.568 --> 32:29.648
Or

32:30.008 --> 32:31.127
you don't believe that she's

32:31.127 --> 32:32.487
only interested in your mom.

32:34.487 --> 32:35.447
I just often don't know

32:35.447 --> 32:36.568
what she's really thinking.

32:38.048 --> 32:39.447
Sometimes I feel it seems like

32:41.928 --> 32:42.968
she's playing dumb.

32:43.768 --> 32:44.768
But sometimes I think

32:44.768 --> 32:46.087
she really hasn't caught on.

32:47.768 --> 32:48.728
Either way,

32:48.728 --> 32:49.888
I'm too passive.

32:50.487 --> 32:51.407
I'm done guessing.

32:53.127 --> 32:54.527
Besides, I'm going abroad soon.

32:55.648 --> 32:56.808
We won't work out.

33:17.327 --> 33:18.207
I think it's enough.

33:18.527 --> 33:19.407
Check for anything

33:19.407 --> 33:20.207
to fix.

33:20.568 --> 33:21.167
Let me see.

33:25.048 --> 33:25.447
Okay.

33:25.888 --> 33:27.167
Let's go with this.

33:27.487 --> 33:28.008
Okay.

33:29.688 --> 33:30.527
Everything is ready,

33:30.648 --> 33:31.888
we just need a photographer.

33:32.808 --> 33:33.768
Chen Luzhou said what?

33:34.848 --> 33:36.207
He didn't agree or refuse.

33:36.287 --> 33:37.487
He'll check his schedule.

33:38.888 --> 33:40.527
Should we ask him again?

33:41.127 --> 33:41.648
Okay.

33:53.568 --> 33:54.648
Good shot!

33:59.768 --> 34:04.074
(Stay focused. Victory
in the College Entrance Examination!)

34:13.688 --> 34:15.367
(Have you decided about the shop visit?)

34:24.568 --> 34:26.568
(Sorry, I got a rush job.)

34:26.928 --> 34:27.648
(I can't go.)

34:33.968 --> 34:36.487
(There's a job shooting a convoy.
Are you taking it?)

34:37.048 --> 34:38.087
(The price is negotiable.)

34:41.568 --> 34:42.487
(Okay.)

34:47.407 --> 34:48.008
It's for you.

34:48.327 --> 34:48.968
Hello, Senior.

34:49.568 --> 34:50.207
Hello.

34:50.688 --> 34:51.407
Senior Luzhou,

34:51.768 --> 34:53.287
could you sign a message for me?

34:55.127 --> 34:55.888
He's busy.

34:57.247 --> 34:58.728
Then we'll have to find someone else.

35:01.167 --> 35:02.367
(Successful shooting.)

35:06.808 --> 35:09.527
Great Photographer Chen
isn't joining us to make money.

35:09.848 --> 35:12.367
He went back to school
to sign autographs for underclassmen.

35:13.728 --> 35:14.247
Look.

35:15.087 --> 35:17.327
A lark in No.1 High School,
who sings very well.

35:17.487 --> 35:18.327
One grade below.

35:18.848 --> 35:20.600
(Got a message from Senior Luzhou.)
She was on a TV talent show.

35:25.367 --> 35:26.127
Do you think

35:27.287 --> 35:28.728
Chen Luzhou really considers us

35:28.728 --> 35:30.048
as friends or not?

35:30.447 --> 35:31.487
What do you mean?

35:32.728 --> 35:33.768
Nothing.

35:34.728 --> 35:35.768
I just feel that

35:35.888 --> 35:37.407
although we know each other,

35:37.487 --> 35:38.648
in the end,

35:38.888 --> 35:40.327
everyone returns to their circles.

35:42.447 --> 35:44.648
Even if that's the case,
it's normal, right?

35:44.728 --> 35:45.928
Anyway, he's going abroad.

35:46.207 --> 35:47.848
After that, we'll rarely interact.

36:01.688 --> 36:02.367
Don't worry.

36:02.447 --> 36:04.247
The world will turn without Chen Luzhou.

36:04.568 --> 36:05.768
Just a photographer.

36:05.768 --> 36:07.407
I can find you someone even more...

36:08.407 --> 36:09.447
Almost the same.

36:10.968 --> 36:11.848
I'll look right now.

36:19.648 --> 36:20.087
Lucy.

36:22.487 --> 36:23.207
Why did he come?

36:24.167 --> 36:25.127
This guy.

36:25.407 --> 36:26.447
Here to find you?

36:28.648 --> 36:30.127
You guys go ahead. I'm leaving.

36:31.487 --> 36:32.768
Why run away, Chen Luzhou?

36:33.048 --> 36:33.808
What's he worth?

36:33.928 --> 36:34.888
That's not you.

36:37.048 --> 36:38.527
If you leave, we're done.

36:39.487 --> 36:40.648
Can you just spare me, okay?

36:42.048 --> 36:43.207
Didn't you say he was sneaky?

36:43.367 --> 36:44.327
I'll just be cautious.

36:45.287 --> 36:46.008
No excuses.

36:46.127 --> 36:47.928
You're just scared
to confront him directly.

37:00.487 --> 37:00.968
Watch out.

37:02.848 --> 37:03.768
Come on, pass it over.

37:05.968 --> 37:06.247
Here!

37:08.367 --> 37:08.888
Nice shot!

37:13.648 --> 37:14.167
Defense!

37:14.167 --> 37:14.608
Nice shot!

37:26.527 --> 37:26.888
Nice!

37:26.888 --> 37:27.648
Get the rebound!

37:27.968 --> 37:28.888
Nice shot!

37:29.048 --> 37:30.127
Double dribble?

37:33.808 --> 37:34.608
Stay closer.

37:36.127 --> 37:36.407
There!

37:38.327 --> 37:39.568
Don't let him through.

37:46.207 --> 37:46.648
Lucy.

37:47.688 --> 37:48.327
Are you okay?

37:48.688 --> 37:49.367
Can you do it?

37:49.768 --> 37:50.768
- Are you okay?
- Hurt?

37:51.848 --> 37:53.367
Tan Xu, why did you kick him?

37:53.487 --> 37:54.008
Go!

37:54.768 --> 37:55.048
Come.

37:55.568 --> 37:56.367
Lucy, get up first.

37:58.768 --> 37:59.367
Walk this way.

37:59.367 --> 38:00.367
- Slow down.
- Slow down.

38:00.608 --> 38:01.768
Hang in there.

38:10.136 --> 38:11.357
(The Origin of Man)

38:11.357 --> 38:12.848
That's the air conditioner remote.

38:13.008 --> 38:13.527
Look!

38:13.808 --> 38:14.648
On and off.

38:14.928 --> 38:16.207
Messing up the air conditioner.

38:20.127 --> 38:22.167
Come on. Tell me.

38:22.568 --> 38:24.127
What made you unhappy?

38:25.888 --> 38:26.728
Why

38:26.848 --> 38:28.768
are people less happy
as they grow older?

38:30.848 --> 38:32.247
In theory,

38:32.407 --> 38:34.407
it's because you've grown up

38:34.568 --> 38:35.568
and seen more.

38:35.688 --> 38:37.327
Your world's expanded.

38:37.447 --> 38:39.447
What used to thrill you

38:39.608 --> 38:40.848
doesn't anymore.

38:42.207 --> 38:42.968
For example?

38:44.487 --> 38:46.487
For example,
you used to get upset as a child.

38:46.487 --> 38:48.367
I just had to give you candy back then,

38:48.367 --> 38:49.728
and you could be happy all day.

38:50.008 --> 38:52.048
But later on, as you gradually grew up,

38:52.048 --> 38:53.728
one piece of candy was no longer enough.

38:53.888 --> 38:56.287
Then I had to take you
to the amusement park,

38:56.407 --> 38:57.888
buy you beautiful clothes,

38:57.888 --> 38:59.768
and even help you
run for class president.

38:59.888 --> 39:01.407
Was I like this when I was little?

39:02.327 --> 39:03.008
Look,

39:03.447 --> 39:06.087
the video of my dear daughter's
class president election.

39:06.287 --> 39:07.888
I've always kept it on my phone.

39:10.848 --> 39:11.648
I've kept it.

39:12.287 --> 39:13.848
Hello everyone, my name is Xu Zhi.

39:14.127 --> 39:15.608
Napoleon once said that

39:15.808 --> 39:18.367
a soldier who doesn't
want to be a general isn't a good one.

39:19.008 --> 39:21.768
Although I am not as rich as Lin Zixuan,

39:21.888 --> 39:23.487
I'm pretty.

39:23.848 --> 39:26.888
Lin Zixuan's money
won't all be spent on you.

39:27.327 --> 39:30.087
But my beauty is completely unreserved.

39:30.367 --> 39:31.608
You all can see.

39:31.768 --> 39:32.968
I hope all vote for me.

39:33.688 --> 39:35.968
But if I am elected class president,

39:36.367 --> 39:38.287
I hope everyone
can cooperate with me in work.

39:38.287 --> 39:39.608
Don't make this hard for me.

39:39.888 --> 39:40.728
Thank you all.

39:42.487 --> 39:44.167
Okay, keep it for your own viewing.

39:44.327 --> 39:45.688
Just don't spread it around.

39:48.688 --> 39:50.527
In the past, candy could soothe you.

39:50.728 --> 39:52.608
But now, even a mountain of candy

39:52.608 --> 39:53.848
might not make you happy.

39:55.327 --> 39:56.167
I also know

39:56.888 --> 39:58.167
that sooner or later,

39:58.928 --> 40:00.247
I won't be able to cheer you up.

40:00.447 --> 40:02.247
By then, there'll definitely be someone

40:02.247 --> 40:03.207
who can make you happy.

40:03.768 --> 40:04.648
However, I hope

40:05.127 --> 40:07.048
that person can appear later.

40:08.287 --> 40:10.167
Dad, don't worry.

40:10.447 --> 40:11.608
I don't need cheering up now.

40:12.008 --> 40:13.367
I just need to make money.

40:15.688 --> 40:16.688
Make money?

40:17.808 --> 40:18.568
Think about it,

40:18.648 --> 40:19.848
I'm going to study in Beijing.

40:19.968 --> 40:21.527
It will cost more than in Qingyi.

40:22.247 --> 40:23.728
I have to earn some pocket money.

40:24.648 --> 40:25.608
Got time.

40:26.928 --> 40:29.527
I'm going with Cai Yingying
tomorrow to Linshi.

40:30.087 --> 40:30.808
Visit a shop.

40:31.327 --> 40:32.127
Earn some money.

40:32.808 --> 40:34.487
You can make money by visiting shops?

40:35.968 --> 40:36.688
Impressive, right?

40:39.167 --> 40:44.447
Let me check whether
inviting shops is profitable.

40:48.527 --> 40:49.608
Sorry.

40:49.808 --> 40:50.888
I'm late.

40:51.327 --> 40:51.848
Aren't you...

40:51.928 --> 40:53.167
Couldn't sleep last night.

40:53.167 --> 40:54.608
Felt dizzy in the morning.

40:54.928 --> 40:56.327
Took a long time to make soy milk.

40:56.487 --> 40:57.087
Couldn't sleep?

40:57.447 --> 40:58.487
Why?

40:59.928 --> 41:01.848
Something is wrong with Zhi.

41:02.447 --> 41:03.048
What's wrong?

41:03.487 --> 41:04.327
Here's the hospital.

41:04.487 --> 41:05.648
Take her here to check.

41:05.728 --> 41:07.527
The doctor can't help.

41:08.247 --> 41:08.888
Ever since

41:09.327 --> 41:11.048
she came back from Fu Yu Villa,

41:11.167 --> 41:12.608
I've felt something's off.

41:12.728 --> 41:14.608
Last night, she grabbed the AC remote,

41:14.608 --> 41:15.447
and went to watch TV.

41:16.048 --> 41:17.928
In the middle of the night,
she oddly asked me,

41:18.447 --> 41:20.808
"Why are people less happy
as they grow older?"

41:20.968 --> 41:21.928
The whole day she's been

41:22.447 --> 41:23.247
absent-minded.

41:24.327 --> 41:25.287
Do you think

41:25.808 --> 41:27.568
she might be in love?

41:29.928 --> 41:30.768
Impossible.

41:30.768 --> 41:32.568
D-Didn't you ask her?

41:33.127 --> 41:34.287
She mentioned that...

41:34.568 --> 41:35.287
That Xu guy...

41:35.608 --> 41:35.968
No.

41:35.968 --> 41:36.608
Just classmates.

41:37.167 --> 41:37.888
New situation.

41:38.527 --> 41:40.287
N-New situation? What...

41:40.968 --> 41:42.167
Quick, look at the phone.

41:43.327 --> 41:44.167
Look at this.

41:47.087 --> 41:47.648
Take a look.

41:47.768 --> 41:48.648
Look, you see.

41:49.888 --> 41:50.888
Chen Luzhou.

41:51.568 --> 41:52.527
Nice picture.

41:53.207 --> 41:54.327
Just this, you...

41:54.608 --> 41:55.327
I think

41:55.888 --> 41:56.808
you need to check,

41:56.808 --> 41:58.127
or ask the child again.

41:58.928 --> 41:59.447
How do I ask?

42:00.367 --> 42:01.928
She definitely won't tell.

42:02.447 --> 42:03.048
Needs checking.

42:04.888 --> 42:07.103
(Andrology, Treatment Room One)

42:11.968 --> 42:13.728
(1034.)

42:13.728 --> 42:16.048
(Chen Luzhou, consultation room 7.)

42:17.367 --> 42:18.327
It's your turn.

42:28.287 --> 42:29.648
Hello, over here.

42:29.968 --> 42:30.848
Doctor.

42:33.247 --> 42:34.247
Where's the discomfort?

42:35.447 --> 42:37.287
I bumped into someone
while playing ball.

42:38.616 --> 42:41.592
(Chen Luzhou)

42:48.648 --> 42:50.087
Are you Chen Luzhou?

42:51.367 --> 42:52.407
I am Chen Luzhou.

43:15.096 --> 43:17.240
(Everyone has a wall in their heart.)

43:17.240 --> 43:19.544
(It seems solid, but it can be broken)

43:19.704 --> 43:22.040
(by one sentence,)

43:22.040 --> 43:27.733
(or a moment of collapse.)

43:28.825 --> 43:34.641
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

43:35.193 --> 43:40.721
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

43:42.233 --> 43:46.681
♪The world is too quiet♪

43:47.673 --> 43:54.601
♪Amplifying all the sounds♪

43:55.513 --> 44:00.601
♪Who will visit me♪

44:01.657 --> 44:07.281
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

44:08.025 --> 44:11.081
♪Turning the frozen loneliness♪

44:11.321 --> 44:16.641
♪Into concern and care♪

44:22.169 --> 44:27.281
♪Watching stars rise and fall♪

44:27.801 --> 44:33.641
♪Gently pushing me to tour your world♪

44:35.097 --> 44:38.481
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

44:38.617 --> 44:44.841
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

44:45.337 --> 44:48.281
♪The lonely clock♪

44:48.441 --> 44:53.041
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

44:53.433 --> 44:56.681
♪Are we both♪

44:56.953 --> 45:00.481
♪Attracted to each other♪

45:01.625 --> 45:08.241
♪Falling into you♪

45:11.961 --> 45:17.761
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

45:18.617 --> 45:21.281
♪Just a few more embraces away♪

45:21.817 --> 45:26.441
♪From reaching eternity♪

45:26.841 --> 45:30.121
♪After rushing recklessly♪

45:30.329 --> 45:33.761
♪We approach each other♪

45:35.033 --> 45:38.641
♪Without turning back♪

45:40.025 --> 45:47.681
♪In your eyes, I see myself♪

45:48.313 --> 45:54.801
♪Falling into you♪
